<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="recommended-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_penance.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Discipline Priests in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-discipline-priest-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="$color" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Discipline Priest gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list of ideal Discipline Priest drops found in Phase 4 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>Most of your best pieces this tier will drop in the new Siege of Orgrimmar raid, but while gearing up you'll often add gear from other sources, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Discipline Priests</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you. <br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Discipline Priests</h3>
<div class="box" data-level="null">
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102247/jina-kang-kindness-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Jina-Kang, Kindness of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_cranehealer_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jina-Kang, Kindness of Chi-Ji</span></a> and <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102246/xing-ho-breath-of-yulon">
<img alt="Xing-Ho, Breath of Yu'lon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_dragoncaster_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Xing-Ho, Breath of Yu'lon</span></a> are both very good at their respective roles of adding Healing and DPS. I recommend grabbing both and switching on a fight by fight basis depending on what you feel will be of greater value. Default to the healing cape if you're not sure.</div>
